<title>USA: Millenium Chemicals Inc Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Millenium Chemicals Inc Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MILLENNIUM CHEMICALS</p>
<p>			 Combined Statements of Operations</p>
<p>		     ($ In Millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three months ended  Nine months ended</p>
<p>					 September 30	September 30</p>
<p>				 1996     1995	     1996    1995</p>
<p> Net sales		     769     764	    2,279   2,491</p>
<p>Operating costs &amp; expenses</p>
<p>   Cost of products sold   565     507	    1,711   1,542</p>
<p>Selling, development</p>
<p>and administrative</p>
<p>    expenses		    49	42		136     130</p>
<p> EBITDA			  155     215		432     819</p>
<p>   Operating income	  105     165		280     664</p>
<p>   Net interest expense     50	54		146     161</p>
<p>(Gain) on disposal</p>
<p>of Suburban</p>
<p>    Propane interest	   2	--	    (210)	--</p>
<p>Income from continuing</p>
<p>operations before provision  </p>
<p>  for income taxes	    23     113		270     464</p>
<p>Provision for</p>
<p>  Income Taxes		(13)    (42)	    (167)   (188)</p>
<p>Income from continuing</p>
<p>  operations		    10	71		103     276</p>
