<p>  continuing operations    .29    1.14	     1.73    4.18</p>
<p>Millions of shares used</p>
<p>  to compute EPS	  75.128  75.128	   75.128  75.128</p>
<p>NOTE: (1)Includes addback of $60 million in 2Q96 and $15 million in 3Q96 for charges relating to sulfate-process TiO2 production facility closures.</p>
<p>Pro forma earnings per share are calculated in accordance with GAAP as presented in the Company's Information Statement filed in connection with the Company's spin-off from Hanson PLC.  Pro forma earnings per share assume that the Company was a stand-alone entity for all periods presented and the spin- off from Hanson Plc had been consummated on January 1, 1995 and include for the first quarter of 1996 the gain realized on the disposition of a 73.6 percent interest in Suburban Propane.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
